## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design both memoized and tabulated DP for string segmentation, a core DP pattern with practical constraints.

## Key Concepts

- Top-down memoization
- Bottom-up tabulation
- Pruning with maxWordLen
- Edge-case handling for empty string

## Code Example

```javascript
function countWaysTop(s, dict) {
  const max = Math.max(...Array.from(dict).map(w => w.length), 0);
  const memo = new Map();
  const dfs = (i) => {
    if (i === s.length) return 1;
    if (memo.has(i)) return memo.get(i);
    let res = 0;
    for (let len = 1; len <= max && i + len <= s.length; len++) {
      const sub = s.slice(i, i + len);
      if (dict.has(sub)) res += dfs(i + len);
    }
    memo.set(i, res);
    return res;
  };
  return dfs(0);
}
```

